{% comment %}
  ==================================================================
  FULL WIDTH IMAGE / TEXT v2
  Ported from gs-shopify-v3 sections/full-width-image-with-text-v2.liquid
  ==================================================================
  The two hero promos at the very top of the homepage - the BOGO bar and
  the BACK IN STOCK hoodies banner. First thing anyone sees.

  v1 (sections/full-width-image-with-text.liquid, 17.5 KB) is superseded
  and NOT ported. See DUP-017.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  FOUR BROKEN VARIABLE REFERENCES
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  v3's opening liquid block had:

  1. assign horizontal_content_alignment = 'bottom'
     Missing the _desktop suffix. The variable actually used downstream
     is horizontal_content_alignment_desktop, which in the center case
     was therefore NEVER ASSIGNED. The gradient overlay then emitted:
         linear-gradient(to , transparent, ...)
     Invalid CSS - the whole overlay silently disappears. This affects
     any instance with centre alignment AND a gradient overlay.

  2. assign horizontal_content_alignment_mobile = horizontal_section.settings.content_alignment_mobile
     `horizontal_section` is not an object. Always nil.

  3. assign content_alignment_mobile = section.settings.content_alignment_mobile
     No such setting (it is horizontal_content_alignment_mobile), and
     the variable it assigns to is never read. Dead twice over.

  4. {% raw %}{% if section.settings.full_width_video == blank %}{% endraw %} in the CSS.
     The settings are full_width_video_desktop and _mobile. There is no
     full_width_video, so the condition was always true.

  Also referenced but nonexistent: section.settings.subcopy_font_weight.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  HEX OPACITY LOOKUP TABLE REPLACED
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  v3 mapped percentages to hex alpha suffixes with a 10-case `case`
  statement, appending them to the colour string. Two problems:

    - 30% mapped to '46' (= 27.5%), not '4d'. Off by a visible amount.
    - Appending hex to a colour that is rgba(0,0,0,0) - which is what a
      cleared colour picker returns - produced `rgba(0,0,0,0)80`, which
      is invalid.

  Replaced with Liquid's color_modify filter, which is exact and handles
  every input form.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  target="blank" IS NOT target="_blank"
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Without the underscore this is a NAMED window called "blank", not a
  new tab - so every such link reuses the same window. Fixed in both
  places, and rel="noopener noreferrer" added.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  MOBILE IMAGE WAS EFFECTIVELY REQUIRED
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  The wrapper was gated on:
      {% raw %}{% if section.settings.full_width_image_desktop and section.settings.full_width_image_mobile %}{% endraw %}
  Both. But the mobile picker is labelled "(optional)". Leave it empty
  and the entire section vanishes with no indication why. Now requires
  only the desktop image, and falls back to it on mobile.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  UNQUOTED MULTI-WORD FONT FAMILIES
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  The font settings emit values like `Engravers MT` and `GregorianFLF`
  straight into font-family. A multi-word family name MUST be quoted -
  `font-family: Engravers MT;` is invalid and the declaration is
  dropped. Now quoted with a fallback stack.

  WARNING: `GregorianFLF` is offered in both font dropdowns but there is
  NO matching font asset in the theme - assets/ has EngraversMT.TTF and
  EngraversMTBold.ttf only. Selecting GregorianFLF silently renders the
  fallback. Either add the font or remove the option.

  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  OTHER FIXES
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  - `.heading *` and `.subcopy *` universal descendant selectors
    replaced with targeted rules.
  - Per-instance CSS moved to custom properties + an asset stylesheet.
  - t: keys -> English.

  All schema setting IDs are byte-for-byte identical to v3.
  ==================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'gs-full-width-image-text.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- liquid
  assign img_desktop = section.settings.full_width_image_desktop
  assign img_mobile = section.settings.full_width_image_mobile | default: img_desktop
  assign video_desktop = section.settings.full_width_video_desktop
  assign video_mobile = section.settings.full_width_video_mobile

  assign has_video = false
  if video_desktop != blank or video_mobile != blank
    assign has_video = true
  endif

  comment
    Overlay colour. v3 used a 10-case hex-suffix lookup with a wrong
    entry for 30% and no handling for transparent inputs.
  endcomment
  assign overlay_alpha = section.settings.overlay_opacity | divided_by: 100.0
  assign overlay_rgba = section.settings.overlay_color | color_modify: 'alpha', overlay_alpha

  comment
    Desktop alignment. v3 assigned to horizontal_content_alignment
    (no suffix) in the else branch, leaving the real variable nil.
  endcomment
  case section.settings.horizontal_content_alignment_desktop
    when 'left'
      assign gradient_dir_desktop = 'left'
      assign align_items_desktop = 'flex-start'
      assign margin_desktop = '0 auto 0 0'
    when 'right'
      assign gradient_dir_desktop = 'right'
      assign align_items_desktop = 'flex-end'
      assign margin_desktop = '0 0 0 auto'
    else
      assign gradient_dir_desktop = 'bottom'
      assign align_items_desktop = 'center'
      assign margin_desktop = '0 auto'
  endcase

  case section.settings.horizontal_content_alignment_mobile
    when 'left'
      assign gradient_dir_mobile = 'left'
      assign align_items_mobile = 'flex-start'
      assign margin_mobile = '0 auto 0 0'
    when 'right'
      assign gradient_dir_mobile = 'right'
      assign align_items_mobile = 'flex-end'
      assign margin_mobile = '0 0 0 auto'
    else
      assign gradient_dir_mobile = 'bottom'
      assign align_items_mobile = 'center'
      assign margin_mobile = '0 auto'
  endcase

  assign link_url = section.settings.full_image_cta_url
  assign wrap_in_link = false
  if section.settings.full_image_link and link_url != blank
    assign wrap_in_link = true
  endif
-%}

{%- capture hero_media -%}
  {%- if has_video -%}
    {%- if video_desktop != blank -%}
      {{ video_desktop | video_tag: image_size: '1600x', class: 'small--hide', autoplay: true, loop: true, muted: true, controls: false }}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if video_mobile != blank -%}
      {{ video_mobile | video_tag: image_size: '900x', class: 'medium-up--hide', autoplay: true, loop: true, muted: true, controls: false }}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- elsif section.settings.image_height_auto -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign loading = 'lazy'
      assign fetch = 'auto'
      if section.index0 < 2
        assign loading = 'eager'
        assign fetch = 'high'
      endif
    -%}
    {{
      img_desktop
      | image_url: width: 2000
      | image_tag:
        class: 'small--hide',
        alt: img_desktop.alt,
        width: img_desktop.width,
        height: img_desktop.height,
        widths: '600, 900, 1200, 1500, 2000',
        sizes: '100vw',
        loading: loading,
        fetchpriority: fetch
    }}
    {{
      img_mobile
      | image_url: width: 1200
      | image_tag:
        class: 'medium-up--hide',
        alt: img_mobile.alt,
        width: img_mobile.width,
        height: img_mobile.height,
        widths: '300, 600, 900, 1200',
        sizes: '100vw',
        loading: loading,
        fetchpriority: fetch
    }}
  {%- endif -%}

  <div class="content-wrapper">
    <div class="content">
      {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
        <div class="heading">{{ section.settings.heading }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.subcopy != blank -%}
        <div class="subcopy">{{ section.settings.subcopy }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.show_cta and section.settings.cta_link_text != blank -%}
        {%- if wrap_in_link -%}
          {%- comment -%} Whole hero is already a link - must not nest another. {%- endcomment -%}
          <span class="{{ section.settings.cta_link_type }}">{{ section.settings.cta_link_text }}</span>
        {%- else -%}
          <a
            href="{{ link_url }}"
            class="{{ section.settings.cta_link_type }}"
            {% if section.settings.link_new_window %}target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"{% endif %}
          >
            {{- section.settings.cta_link_text -}}
          </a>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.terms_text != blank -%}
        <p class="terms">{{ section.settings.terms_text }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- if img_desktop != blank or has_video -%}
  <div
    class="gs-fwit gs-fwit--visibility-{{ section.settings.section_visibility }}{% unless section.settings.image_height_auto %} gs-fwit--bg-image{% endunless %}"
    style="
      --fwit-section-pad: {{ section.settings.section_padding_top_bottom_desktop }}px;
      --fwit-section-pad-mobile: {{ section.settings.section_padding_top_bottom_mobile }}px;
      --fwit-content-pad: {{ section.settings.content_padding_top_bottom_desktop }}px {{ section.settings.content_padding_left_right_desktop }}px;
      --fwit-content-pad-mobile: {{ section.settings.content_padding_top_bottom_mobile }}px {{ section.settings.content_padding_left_right_mobile }}px;
      --fwit-content-width: {{ section.settings.content_width }};
      --fwit-content-margin: {{ margin_desktop }};
      --fwit-content-margin-mobile: {{ margin_mobile }};
      --fwit-justify: {{ section.settings.vertical_content_alignment_desktop }};
      --fwit-justify-mobile: {{ section.settings.vertical_content_alignment_mobile }};
      --fwit-align: {{ align_items_desktop }};
      --fwit-align-mobile: {{ align_items_mobile }};
      --fwit-text-align: {{ section.settings.horizontal_content_alignment_desktop }};
      --fwit-text-align-mobile: {{ section.settings.horizontal_content_alignment_mobile }};
      --fwit-gap: {{ section.settings.content_items_gap }}px;
      --fwit-heading-size: {{ section.settings.heading_size_desktop }}px;
      --fwit-heading-size-mobile: {{ section.settings.heading_size_mobile }}px;
      --fwit-heading-font: "{{ section.settings.heading_font }}", sans-serif;
      --fwit-heading-color: {{ section.settings.heading_color }};
      --fwit-subcopy-size: {{ section.settings.subcopy_size_desktop }}px;
      --fwit-subcopy-size-mobile: {{ section.settings.subcopy_size_mobile }}px;
      --fwit-subcopy-font: "{{ section.settings.subcopy_font }}", sans-serif;
      --fwit-subcopy-color: {{ section.settings.subcopy_color }};
      --fwit-cta-size: {{ section.settings.cta_link_text_size_desktop }}px;
      --fwit-cta-size-mobile: {{ section.settings.cta_link_text_size_mobile }}px;
      --fwit-cta-color: {{ section.settings.cta_link_text_color }};
      --fwit-cta-bg: {{ section.settings.cta_bg_color }};
      --fwit-cta-pad: {{ section.settings.cta_padding_top_bottom_desktop }}px {{ section.settings.cta_padding_left_right_desktop }}px;
      --fwit-cta-pad-mobile: {{ section.settings.cta_padding_top_bottom_mobile }}px {{ section.settings.cta_padding_left_right_mobile }}px;
      --fwit-cta-weight: {% if section.settings.cta_link_link_font_weight %}700{% else %}400{% endif %};
      --fwit-terms-size: {{ section.settings.terms_text_size_desktop }}px;
      --fwit-terms-size-mobile: {{ section.settings.terms_text_size_mobile }}px;
      --fwit-terms-color: {{ section.settings.terms_color }};
      --fwit-terms-link-color: {{ section.settings.terms_link_color }};
      --fwit-terms-weight: {% if section.settings.terms_font_weight %}700{% else %}400{% endif %};
      {%- unless section.settings.image_height_auto -%}
        --fwit-bg-desktop: url('{{ img_desktop | image_url: width: 2000 }}');
        --fwit-bg-mobile: url('{{ img_mobile | image_url: width: 1200 }}');
      {%- endunless -%}
      {%- if section.settings.overlay_opacity_type == 'gradient' -%}
        --fwit-overlay: linear-gradient(to {{ gradient_dir_desktop }}, transparent, {{ overlay_rgba }} {{ section.settings.overlay_gradient_start_at }}%);
        --fwit-overlay-mobile: linear-gradient(to {{ gradient_dir_mobile }}, transparent, {{ overlay_rgba }} {{ section.settings.overlay_gradient_start_at }}%);
      {%- elsif section.settings.overlay_opacity_type == 'solid' -%}
        --fwit-overlay: {{ overlay_rgba }};
        --fwit-overlay-mobile: {{ overlay_rgba }};
      {%- else -%}
        --fwit-overlay: transparent;
        --fwit-overlay-mobile: transparent;
      {%- endif -%}
    "
  >
    <div class="full-width-image-with-text{% unless section.settings.section_full_width %} page-width{% endunless %}">
      {%- if wrap_in_link -%}
        <a
          class="gs-fwit__link"
          href="{{ link_url }}"
          {% if section.settings.link_new_window %}target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"{% endif %}
          aria-label="{{ section.settings.heading | strip_html | escape | default: section.settings.cta_link_text }}"
        >
          {{ hero_media }}
        </a>
      {%- else -%}
        {{ hero_media }}
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Full Width Image/Text_v2",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section gs-fwit-section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "General" },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "section_visibility",
      "label": "Show section on",
      "options": [
        { "value": "always", "label": "All devices" },
        { "value": "small", "label": "Mobile only" },
        { "value": "large", "label": "Desktop only" }
      ],
      "default": "always"
    },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "section_full_width", "label": "Full width", "default": false },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "full_image_link", "label": "Link the whole image", "default": false },
    { "type": "url", "id": "full_image_cta_url", "label": "Link URL" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "link_new_window", "label": "Open link in a new tab", "default": false },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Background image / video" },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "full_width_image_desktop",
      "label": "Desktop background image",
      "info": "Required. Overridden by video if one is set."
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "full_width_image_mobile",
      "label": "Mobile background image",
      "info": "Optional - falls back to the desktop image."
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "image_height_auto",
      "label": "Auto image height",
      "info": "On: height stays proportional to width. Off: height comes from content padding, and the image is used as a CSS background. Turn off when using video.",
      "default": true
    },
    { "type": "video", "id": "full_width_video_desktop", "label": "Background video (desktop)" },
    { "type": "video", "id": "full_width_video_mobile", "label": "Background video (mobile)" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "overlay_color", "label": "Overlay color", "default": "#000000" },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "overlay_opacity_type",
      "label": "Overlay type",
      "info": "Gradient fades from transparent toward the content edge.",
      "options": [
        { "value": "none", "label": "None" },
        { "value": "gradient", "label": "Gradient" },
        { "value": "solid", "label": "Solid" }
      ],
      "default": "none"
    },
    { "type": "range", "id": "overlay_opacity", "label": "Overlay opacity", "min": 0, "max": 100, "step": 10, "unit": "%", "default": 50 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "overlay_gradient_start_at", "label": "Gradient starts at", "min": 25, "max": 100, "step": 25, "unit": "%", "default": 100 },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Content" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading" },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "heading_font",
      "label": "Heading font",
      "info": "GregorianFLF has no font file in this theme and will fall back.",
      "options": [
        { "value": "Roboto", "label": "Roboto" },
        { "value": "Roboto Condensed", "label": "Roboto Condensed" },
        { "value": "Engravers MT", "label": "Engravers MT" },
        { "value": "GregorianFLF", "label": "GregorianFLF" }
      ],
      "default": "Roboto"
    },
    { "type": "range", "id": "heading_size_desktop", "label": "Heading size (desktop)", "min": 16, "max": 72, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 45 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "heading_size_mobile", "label": "Heading size (mobile)", "min": 14, "max": 68, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 42 },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "subcopy", "label": "Subcopy" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "subcopy_size_desktop", "label": "Subcopy size (desktop)", "min": 16, "max": 48, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 24 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "subcopy_size_mobile", "label": "Subcopy size (mobile)", "min": 10, "max": 36, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 18 },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "subcopy_font",
      "label": "Subcopy font",
      "options": [
        { "value": "Roboto", "label": "Roboto" },
        { "value": "Roboto Condensed", "label": "Roboto Condensed" },
        { "value": "Engravers MT", "label": "Engravers MT" },
        { "value": "GregorianFLF", "label": "GregorianFLF" }
      ],
      "default": "Roboto"
    },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_cta", "label": "Show CTA", "default": false },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cta_link_text", "label": "CTA text" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "cta_link_text_size_desktop", "label": "CTA size (desktop)", "min": 16, "max": 48, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 24 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "cta_link_text_size_mobile", "label": "CTA size (mobile)", "min": 10, "max": 36, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 18 },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "cta_link_link_font_weight", "label": "Bold CTA text", "default": false },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "cta_link_type",
      "label": "CTA style",
      "options": [
        { "value": "cta", "label": "Button" },
        { "value": "link", "label": "Text link" }
      ],
      "default": "cta"
    },
    { "type": "inline_richtext", "id": "terms_text", "label": "Terms text" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "terms_text_size_desktop", "label": "Terms size (desktop)", "min": 16, "max": 48, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 24 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "terms_text_size_mobile", "label": "Terms size (mobile)", "min": 10, "max": 36, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 18 },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "terms_font_weight", "label": "Bold terms text", "default": false },
    { "type": "text_alignment", "id": "horizontal_content_alignment_desktop", "label": "Horizontal alignment (desktop)", "default": "right" },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "vertical_content_alignment_desktop",
      "label": "Vertical alignment (desktop)",
      "options": [
        { "value": "flex-start", "label": "Top" },
        { "value": "center", "label": "Center" },
        { "value": "flex-end", "label": "Bottom" }
      ],
      "default": "center"
    },
    { "type": "text_alignment", "id": "horizontal_content_alignment_mobile", "label": "Horizontal alignment (mobile)", "default": "center" },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "vertical_content_alignment_mobile",
      "label": "Vertical alignment (mobile)",
      "options": [
        { "value": "flex-start", "label": "Top" },
        { "value": "center", "label": "Center" },
        { "value": "flex-end", "label": "Bottom" }
      ],
      "default": "flex-end"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "content_width",
      "label": "Content width (desktop)",
      "info": "Mobile is always 100%.",
      "options": [
        { "value": "25%", "label": "25%" },
        { "value": "33%", "label": "33%" },
        { "value": "50%", "label": "50%" },
        { "value": "66%", "label": "66%" },
        { "value": "100%", "label": "100%" }
      ],
      "default": "100%"
    },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Spacing" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "section_padding_top_bottom_desktop", "label": "Section padding (desktop)", "min": 0, "max": 150, "step": 5, "unit": "px", "default": 0 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "section_padding_top_bottom_mobile", "label": "Section padding (mobile)", "min": 0, "max": 150, "step": 5, "unit": "px", "default": 0 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "content_padding_top_bottom_desktop", "label": "Content padding top/bottom (desktop)", "min": 0, "max": 150, "step": 5, "unit": "px", "default": 35 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "content_padding_left_right_desktop", "label": "Content padding left/right (desktop)", "min": 0, "max": 150, "step": 5, "unit": "px", "default": 50 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "content_padding_top_bottom_mobile", "label": "Content padding top/bottom (mobile)", "min": 0, "max": 100, "step": 5, "unit": "px", "default": 50 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "content_padding_left_right_mobile", "label": "Content padding left/right (mobile)", "min": 0, "max": 100, "step": 5, "unit": "px", "default": 25 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "content_items_gap", "label": "Gap between content items", "min": 0, "max": 25, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 0 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "cta_padding_top_bottom_desktop", "label": "CTA padding top/bottom (desktop)", "min": 0, "max": 50, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 4 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "cta_padding_top_bottom_mobile", "label": "CTA padding top/bottom (mobile)", "min": 0, "max": 50, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 4 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "cta_padding_left_right_desktop", "label": "CTA padding left/right (desktop)", "min": 0, "max": 50, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 40 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "cta_padding_left_right_mobile", "label": "CTA padding left/right (mobile)", "min": 0, "max": 50, "step": 1, "unit": "px", "default": 18 },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Colors" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "heading_color", "label": "Heading", "default": "#ffffff" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "subcopy_color", "label": "Subcopy", "default": "#ffffff" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "cta_link_text_color", "label": "CTA text", "default": "#ffffff" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "cta_bg_color", "label": "CTA background", "default": "#ab192d" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "terms_color", "label": "Terms", "default": "#ffffff" },
    { "type": "color", "id": "terms_link_color", "label": "Terms link", "default": "#ffffff" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Full Width Image/Text_v2" }]
}
{% endschema %}
